    diagonal:  A `Tensor` with rank `k`, when `d_lower == d_upper`, or `k + 1`,
      otherwise. `k >= 1`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).
    k: Diagonal offset(s). Positive value means superdiagonal, 0 refers to the
